      "summary_raw": "A customer receives the wrong product. Another discovers a fault after opening the box. Someone else decides the item isn&#8217;t quite what they expected. Returns are part of retail, and the experience doesn&#8217;t end when a customer clicks &#8220;Buy.&#8221; Every return sets off a chain of events behind the scenes. The retailer has to verify [&hellip;]",
      "emoji": "\ud83d\udcf0"
    },
    {
      "headline": "How NetSuite Consultants Can Help Retailers Navigate the NetSuite POS & SCIS Sunset",
      "url": "https://www.lightspeedhq.com/blog/how-netsuite-consultants-can-help-retailers-navigate-the-netsuite-pos-scis-sunset/",
      "date": "Thu, 17 Sep 2026 14:19:25 +0000",
      "source": "Lightspeed blog",
      "company": "Lightspeed",
      "type": "public",
      "content_type": "product_release",
      "summary_raw": "Oracle NetSuite\u2019s sunset of NetSuite Point of Sale (NSPOS) and SuiteCommerce InStore (SCIS) represents a pivotal moment both for retailers and the partners who support them. For retail leaders, replacing a point-of-sale system carries inherent operational risk. Their POS sits at the heart of their business, connecting daily store operations, inventory management, customer profiles, financial [&hellip;]",
      "emoji": "\ud83d\udcf0"
    },
    {
      "headline": "What is POS Experience? Meaning and Strategies to Improve it",
      "url": "https://www.lightspeedhq.com/blog/what-is-pos-experience/",
      "date": "Thu, 17 Sep 2026 13:42:23 +0000",
      "source": "Lightspeed blog",
      "company": "Lightspeed",
      "type": "public",
      "content_type": "product_release",
      "summary_raw": "The POS isn&#8217;t just where the transaction happens. It&#8217;s where the customer decides what they think about the transaction, and sometimes the entire shopping experience. The products weren\u2019t the problem. The checkout experience was. A smooth transaction reinforces a positive shopping experience. A slow queue, declined payment, or confusing return process can leave a lasting [&hellip;]",
      "emoji": "\ud83d\udcf0"
    },
